OL,3,ADocuments falsified to evade tax on
OL,4,AAbramovich's wealth, BBC finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarrister Andrew Mitchell KC, an expert
OL,7,Fin financial services law, said
OL,8,FPanorama's evidence showed the scheme
OL,9,Fwas "straightforward" tax evasion and
OL,10,F"it couldn't be more blatant".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
