OL,3,AOne killed, 11 injured in second Houthi
OL,4,Astrike on Riyadh airport in two days
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has been killed and 11
OL,7,Finjured in a second strike on the
OL,8,Finternational airport in the Saudi
OL,9,Fcapital Riyadh, officials have said.
OL,11,FA Saudi military spokesman said a
OL,12,Fprojectile had hit King Khalid
OL,13,FInternational Airport on Sunday,
OL,14,Fcausing a fire in a passenger hall.
OL,15,FSaudi Arabia's civil aviation authority
OL,16,Fsaid in a statement on X that one
OL,17,Fperson, a Pakistani resident, had been
OL,18,Fkilled in the attack.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
